@startuml
[*] --> AccountCreation : Create Account
AccountCreation --> LoggedIn : Log In
LoggedIn --> VisaApplicationPending : Apply For Visa
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaApproved : Accept Application
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaRejected : Accept Application
LoggedIn --> StatusViewed : View Status
StatusViewed --> FeedbackGiven : Check Status
LoggedIn --> CancelApplication : Cancel Application
LoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : Modify Details
LoggedIn --> ViewDetails : View Details
LoggedIn --> ViewPurposeOfApplication : View Purpose of Application
FeedbackGiven, ModifyDetails, ViewDetails, ViewPurposeOfApplication --> LoggedIn : Log Out
VisaApproved, VisaRejected --> LoggedIn : Log Out
TERMINAL_STATE --> [*] : Log Out
@enduml
